[I] A utility for structural, content-preserving transformations on PDF files

[T] QPDF is a command-line program that does structural, content-preserving
[T] transformations on PDF files. It could have been called something like
[T] pdf-to-pdf.

[U] https://qpdf.sourceforge.net/

